// Menu della workstaff T7+ (SAWorkstaffScreen, aspetto della griglia "quick navigation" di Spectrum): Shift + destro
// apre il menu; clic su una voce = scelta (pacchetto WorkstaffOptionPayload al server). Screenshot di ogni pagina.
// Voci sui vertici di un poligono (WorkstaffMenuLayout, primo in alto, senso orario; 2 voci sinistra/destra), raggio
// scelto dalla schermata (a 1280×720 GUI 3 circa 60-80; caselle 38×38): clic a ±64 per 4 voci (su [0, -64], destra
// [64, 0], giù [0, 64], sinistra [-64, 0]), ±72 in orizzontale per 2, [0, -62] per una voce sola; centro [0, 0].
// Pagine: principale (su Area, destra tasto destro, giù proiettili, sinistra Incantesimi; centro chiude) → Area (su 1x1,
// destra 5x5, giù Area più grande, sinistra 3x3) → Area più grande (7x7; 7x7 e 9x9 con l'Alloy) / Incantesimi (su Silk
// Touch, destra Resonance, giù Drop, sinistra Fortune) → Drop (Foundry; Foundry e Inventory Insertion dal T8).
// Nelle sotto-pagine il centro è Indietro. Le workstaff si danno con gli incantesimi della ricetta.
{
  "description": "Menu della workstaff T7/T8/T9: griglie principale, Area, Area più grande, Incantesimi e Drop (screenshot), scelta di 7x7/9x9, Foundry e Inventory Insertion con i componenti controllati",
  "stop_on_fail": true,
  "steps": [
    {"action": "command", "expect": "any", "commands": ["gamemode creative", "clear @s", "tp @s 0.5 -60 -6.5 180 0"]},

    // --- T7 Umbral ---
    {"action": "hold", "slot": 0, "item": "spectral_ascension:umbral_workstaff[minecraft:enchantments={levels:{'minecraft:fortune':7,'minecraft:efficiency':7,'spectrum:foundry':1}}]"},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "assert_screen", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen"},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_principale"},
    // Area → rombo 1x1 / 5x5 / Area più grande (tooltip) / 3x3, Indietro al centro
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -64]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_area"},
    // Area più grande sul T7: solo 7x7, in alto (tooltip col costo)
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -62], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_area_grande"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -62]},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false},
    {"action": "assert_screen", "screen": "none"},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "assert_item", "slot": "mainhand", "predicate": "spectral_ascension:umbral_workstaff[spectrum:aoe=3]"},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_dopo_7x7"},
    // Incantesimi → rombo Silk Touch / Resonance / Drop / Fortune
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "assert_screen", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-64, 0]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -64], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_incantesimi"},
    // Drop sul T7: solo Foundry (accesa), in alto; la spegne
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -62], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_drop"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -62]},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "assert_item", "slot": "mainhand", "predicate": "spectral_ascension:umbral_workstaff[spectral_ascension:workstaff_drops={foundry:false}]"},
    // Silk Touch con Foundry spenta, poi Foundry accesa → torna Fortune VII con Foundry
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-64, 0]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -64]},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "assert_item", "slot": "mainhand", "item": "spectral_ascension:umbral_workstaff", "enchantments": {"minecraft:silk_touch": 1}},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-64, 0]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -62], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_drop_silk"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -62]},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "assert_item", "slot": "mainhand", "item": "spectral_ascension:umbral_workstaff", "enchantments": {"minecraft:fortune": 7, "spectrum:foundry": 1}},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t7_foundry_fortune"},

    // --- T8 Argent: Drop con Foundry a sinistra e Inventory Insertion a destra; la spegne ---
    {"action": "hold", "slot": 1, "item": "spectral_ascension:argent_workstaff[minecraft:enchantments={levels:{'minecraft:fortune':8,'minecraft:efficiency':8,'spectrum:foundry':1,'spectrum:inventory_insertion':1}}]"},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "assert_screen", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-64, 0]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [72, 0], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t8_drop"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [72, 0]},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "assert_item", "slot": "mainhand", "predicate": "spectral_ascension:argent_workstaff[spectral_ascension:workstaff_drops={insertion:false}]"},

    // --- T9 Prismatic: Area più grande con 7x7 a sinistra e 9x9 a destra, scelta del 9x9 ---
    {"action": "hold", "slot": 2, "item": "spectral_ascension:prismatic_workstaff[minecraft:enchantments={levels:{'minecraft:fortune':11,'minecraft:efficiency':12,'spectrum:foundry':1,'spectrum:inventory_insertion':1}}]"},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "assert_screen", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen"},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t9_principale"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, -64]},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t9_area"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [72, 0], "click": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t9_area_grande"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [72, 0]},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "assert_item", "slot": "mainhand", "predicate": "spectral_ascension:prismatic_workstaff[spectrum:aoe=4]"},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-64, 0]},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t9_incantesimi"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 64]},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t9_drop"},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [0, 0]},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "SAWorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-64, 0], "button": 1},
    {"action": "close_screen"},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false},

    // --- T6: menu di Spectrum invariato (niente Area più grande né Drop) ---
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 10},
    {"action": "command", "command": "item replace entity @s hotbar.3 with spectral_ascension:trichromatic_workstaff[minecraft:enchantments={levels:{'minecraft:fortune':6,'minecraft:efficiency':5}}]"},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 10},
    {"action": "hold", "slot": 3},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": true},
    {"action": "use_item"},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 5},
    {"action": "gui_click", "screen": "WorkstaffScreen", "offset": [-4, -64]},
    {"action": "wait", "ticks": 3},
    {"action": "screenshot", "name": "ws_t6_area_spectrum"},
    {"action": "close_screen"},
    {"action": "sneak", "value": false}
  ]
}
